{"sectionId":"micro/bacteria","items":[{"id":"micro--bacteria-k001","sectionId":"micro/bacteria","unitId":"micro","subject":"biology","text":"세균은 핵막이 없고 보통 원형 염색체와 70S 리보솜을 가진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"micro--bacteria-k002","sectionId":"micro/bacteria","unitId":"micro","subject":"biology","text":"그람양성균은 두꺼운 peptidoglycan과 teichoic acid를, 그람음성균은 얇은 peptidoglycan과 LPS가 포함된 외막을 가진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"micro--bacteria-k003","sectionId":"micro/bacteria","unitId":"micro","subject":"biology","text":"LPS의 lipid A는 내독소 활성에 중요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"micro--bacteria-k004","sectionId":"micro/bacteria","unitId":"micro","subject":"biology","text":"일부 세균의 협막은 부착과 면역 회피, 편모는 운동, pili는 부착 또는 접합에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"micro--bacteria-k005","sectionId":"micro/bacteria","unitId":"micro","subject":"biology","text":"내생포자는 증식 구조가 아닌 생존 구조다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"micro--bacteria-k006","sectionId":"micro/bacteria","unitId":"micro","subject":"biology","text":"증식곡선은 지연기, 대수기, 정체기, 사멸기로 나뉜다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"micro--bacteria-k007","sectionId":"micro/bacteria","unitId":"micro","subject":"biology","text":"이분법으로 분열하며 이상적 증식에서 N=N₀2^(t/g)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"micro--bacteria-k008","sectionId":"micro/bacteria","unitId":"micro","subject":"biology","text":"형질전환은 외부 DNA 흡수, 형질도입은 박테리오파지 매개 DNA 전달, 접합은 직접 접촉에 의한 DNA 전달이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"micro--bacteria-k009","sectionId":"micro/bacteria","unitId":"micro","subject":"biology","text":"항생제 내성은 돌연변이 또는 수평 유전자 전달로 획득될 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"micro--bacteria-k010","sectionId":"micro/bacteria","unitId":"micro","subject":"biology","text":"β-lactam은 세포벽 교차결합에 관여하는 PBP를 억제하며 리보솜 표적 항생제는 단백질 합성을 방해한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"micro--bacteria-k011","sectionId":"micro/bacteria","unitId":"micro","subject":"biology","text":"그람음성 외막의 lipid A: 내독소.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"micro--bacteria-k012","sectionId":"micro/bacteria","unitId":"micro","subject":"biology","text":"형질전환=DNA 직접 흡수, 형질도입=파지, 접합=접촉.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"micro--bacteria-k013","sectionId":"micro/bacteria","unitId":"micro","subject":"biology","text":"항생제는 바이러스의 자체 증식 기구를 표적으로 하는 약이 아니다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"micro--bacteria-k014","sectionId":"micro/bacteria","unitId":"mi